    3. Place cycles on grid with no overlap and Manhattan gap >=2 between any pair.
       Bounding boxes must not nest.
    4. Verify each cycle has convex - concave = 4 (guaranteed by simple-connectivity).
    5. Fill grid background with 0, cycle pixels with foreground color.
